# ShardCache

<div align="center">

**High-Performance, Concurrency-Safe In-Memory Cache for Go**

[![Go Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/Go-%3E%3D%201.20-blue)](https://go.dev/)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg)](LICENSE)

</div>

---

## ✨ Features

ShardCache is a Go in-memory cache library designed specifically for high-concurrency scenarios with the following core advantages:

- 🚀 **Extreme Performance** - Minimizes lock contention through sharding
- 🔒 **Concurrency-Safe** - Native support for multi-goroutine concurrent access
- ♻️ **Zero GC Pressure** - Object reuse via sync.Pool mechanism
- ⚡ **Low Latency** - Average read latency < 50ns
- 🎯 **Zero Allocations** - 0 allocs/op for overwrite operations

---

