```

**Performance Highlights**

| Scenario | Metric | Description |
|---------|---------|------|
| Mixed Read/Write (90/10) | 28.18 ns/op | Perfect shard load balancing |
| Cache Hit | 42.44 ns/op | Zero memory allocations |
| Key Overwrite | 0 allocs/op | sync.Pool object reuse in action |

